方程式 \(x^2 + 2x + 3 = 0\) 的根可以用求根公式計算：

\[
x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}
\]

代入 \(a = 1,\; b = 2,\; c = 3\):

\[
\begin{aligned}
D &= b^2 - 4ac = 2^2 - 4 \times 1 \times 3 = 4 - 12 = -8 \\
x &= \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{-8}}{2} = \frac{-2 \pm 2i\sqrt{2}}{2} \\
  &= -1 \pm i\sqrt{2}
\end{aligned}
\]

因此，方程式的兩個複數根為：

\[
x_1 = -1 + i\sqrt{2}, \quad x_2 = -1 - i\sqrt{2}
\]
